# #272: Illidan's Immolate after the swap with Fan of Knives: a frame-one burst on both sides that pops foes upward,
# a jump cancel from its frame 4, and in the air it holds him in place.
# Illidan a against Illidan b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero illidan
# Both dash in, b ending about 80 in front of a.
40 b stick -1 0
48 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
58 a stick 0 0
# Immolate on the ground with b in front.
92 a stick 0 -1
92 a tap X 2
93 a stick 0 0
# a turns away from b and Immolates with b behind.
200 a stick -0.5 0
204 a stick 0 0
240 a stick 0 -1
240 a tap X 2
241 a stick 0 0
# Immolate in the air, cancelled by a double jump on the first frame it allows (its frame 4 has passed).
320 a tap B 8
332 a stick 0 -1
332 a tap X 2
333 a stick 0 0
336 a tap B 2
# Immolate in the air, run to its end.
420 a tap B 8
432 a stick 0 -1
432 a tap X 2
433 a stick 0 0
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): b in front at 92 and behind at 240 is struck on Immolate's
# frame 1 and popped up and away from a; in the air a holds x and z to the end; the jump cancels it.
#! expect a 92 special 12 form 0 action-frame 1 x -39.480
#! expect b 92 damage 7.000 hitlag 5 hitstun 34
#! expect b 92 launch up 1 from-air 0 x 1.354 z 15.472
#! expect a 200 ground action 0 facing -1
#! expect a 240 special 12 form 0 action-frame 1 x -42.740
#! expect b 240 damage 14.000 hitlag 5 hitstun 35
#! expect b 240 launch up 1 from-air 0 x 1.391 z 15.894
#! expect a 332 special 12 form 0 action-frame 1
#! expect a 336 special 0 form 0 action-frame 0 x -42.740 z 203.660
#! expect a 336 applied jump 2 double 1
#! expect a 432 special 12 form 0 action-frame 1 x -42.740 z 179.300
#! expect a 458 special 0 form 0 action-frame 0 x -42.740 z 179.300
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
